<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;">Zoebook is a <strong>Viral-Based</strong> Social Media that focuses on distributing user content to every user that's on its platform for 48 hours- respectively. For instance- if you have a photo, video, song, or a message that you would like to share with the world- you would always want to post or share that message (photo, video, song, or a message) on the Zoebook platform because that particular post would go to everyone instanstaneously.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">On the Zoebook platform- you will see the term "VP," which means "Viral Post." And- you can click on the VP tab to explore its functionality and utility. A user will always want to utilize the VP tab in order to reach maximum result. After a post has been uploaded using the VP tab- the system will populate the post to every user within the platform.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">We encourage you to download the app or log into the website to share your creative content. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color:brown">Thank you so much for being a part of the Zoebook platform!&nbsp;</span></p>
